HashMap ek data structure hai jo data ko key → value pair mein store karta hai.
HashMap internally hashing use karta hai.

| Operation       | Average |
| --------------- | ------: |
| `put()`         |    O(1) |
| `get()`         |    O(1) |
| `remove()`      |    O(1) |
| `containsKey()` |    O(1) |

Key Takeaway :-
               HashMap = Key ko use karke Value ko efficiently store aur retrieve karna.

